        "created_at": "2019-06-04T22:48:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Loved the sponsor gag. :D This was a real good episode for getting into the nitty gritty of some of the card art, filling in gaps in the stories. When we first heard about Void Guard on the Letters Page, I don't think their decks were out. Hopefully we'll get more dives like this into the final round of Sentinels content.</p>",
